<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT MALTA 1-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT MALTA 1-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CARTAGENA, Spain 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Malta 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a European under-21 championship group six</p>
<p>qualifying match on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Roger Garcia 69</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000.</p>
<p> Standings	     Pl   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Spain		    5   4   1   0   8   2  13</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	     3   2   0   1   4   1   6</p>
<p> Slovakia		 2   1   1   0   4   1   4</p>
<p> Czech Rebublic	 3   1   0   2   5   5   3</p>
<p> Malta		    5   0   0   5   0  12   0</p>
<p>Next match: March 30 - Malta v Slovakia</p>
</text>
